  The extension point is the validator contract: [38;5;153m(value) => string | null[39m. That's the whole abstraction — anything
  matching it composes. Four decisions worth your attention:

  - [1mOnly [38;5;153mrequired[39m ships.[0m No [38;5;153memail[39m, no [38;5;153mminLength[39m. Nothing in the repo needs them, and a validator is three lines to add
    when something does.
  - [1mFirst error per field, all fields collected.[0m A field shows one message at a time; collecting across fields is what
    the error map is for.
  - [1m[38;5;153mrequired[39m trims whitespace.[0m This is a real behavior change: today [38;5;153m" "[39m passes validation, after this it fails. I think
    that's a bug fix, but it is a change, not a refactor.
  - [1m[38;5;153merrors[39m is always present[0m, [38;5;153m{}[39m when valid, so consumers never guard before reading it.

  [1mCall site[0m — [38;5;153mapp.js[39m becomes an ES module: imports [38;5;153mvalidate[39m/[38;5;153mrequired[39m, declares [38;5;153mloginRules[39m, and the submit handler passes
  the DOM values in. The validation module never touches the DOM; the form reads its own inputs. [38;5;153mindex.html[39m gets
  [38;5;153mtype="module"[39m on its script tag.

  Failures still go to [38;5;153mconsole.error[39m, one line per field. [38;5;153mindex.html[39m has no element to display errors in, and adding
  error UI is a different task than the one you asked for — say the word if you want it in scope.

  [1mTests[0m — [38;5;153mtest/validation.test.mjs[39m on [38;5;153mnode:test[39m + [38;5;153mnode:assert[39m, zero dependencies; [38;5;153mpackage.json[39m gains [38;5;153m"scripts": { [39m
  [38;5;153m"test": "node --test" }[39m. Cases: both fields empty, one field empty, whitespace-only, all valid, unknown keys in [38;5;153mvalues
[39m  ignored, rules field missing from [38;5;153mvalues[39m, empty rule set. [38;5;153msrc/index.js[39m and [38;5;153msrc/utils.js[39m stay CommonJS and untouched —
  no [38;5;153m"type"[39m field needed since [38;5;153m.mjs[39m carries it.

